  m_text: 'Welcome!


    In this game the player navigates the camera using their
    head.

    To achieve this we use real-time video analysis to detect the players
    position in  space.

    This requires a machine with a webcam mounted at the
    top of the screen.


    Unfortunately, if you do not have a webcam available,
    you are unable to play this game.

    We apologize for the inconvenience.'
